  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "Hansel",
  "description": "Hansel is a high-quality human-annotated Chinese entity linking (EL) dataset, used for testing Chinese EL systems' generalization ability to tail entities and emerging entities.\nThe test set contains Few-shot (FS) and zero-shot (ZS) slices, has 10K examples and uses Wikidata as the corresponding knowledge base.\nThe training and validation sets are from Wikipedia hyperlinks, useful for large-scale pretraining of Chinese EL systems.",
  "alternateName": [
    "HIT-TMG/Hansel",
    "Hansel"
  ],
